991
00:38:41,080 --> 00:38:42,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay, that's better.</font></font>

992
00:38:43,720 --> 00:38:45,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just lean a little toward me.</font></font>

993
00:38:46,480 --> 00:38:48,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Here's what happened that day.</font></font>

994
00:38:48,520 --> 00:38:50,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They'd won, right?</font></font>

995
00:38:51,720 --> 00:38:53,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And he chose me for the date.</font></font>

996
00:38:53,320 --> 00:38:53,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

997
00:38:53,960 --> 00:38:54,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And...</font></font>

998
00:38:55,600 --> 00:38:57,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I actually went in</font></font>

999
00:38:57,080 --> 00:38:59,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">with a pretty relaxed attitude.</font></font>

1000
00:38:59,560 --> 00:39:05,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But then he told me</font></font>

1001
00:39:05,560 --> 00:39:07,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that our lifestyles</font></font>

1002
00:39:07,680 --> 00:39:08,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">were quite different.</font></font>

1003
00:39:09,240 --> 00:39:10,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[A different lifestyle from Zheng Shoudong]</font></font>

1004
00:39:10,600 --> 00:39:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He was thinking about</font></font>

1005
00:39:12,040 --> 00:39:15,120
