1006
00:39:15,120 --> 00:39:17,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I really appreciated that,</font></font>

1007
00:39:17,840 --> 00:39:20,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">because it showed he was seriously</font></font>

1008
00:39:20,240 --> 00:39:22,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">thinking about us.</font></font>

1009
00:39:22,360 --> 00:39:23,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But over the next few days,</font></font>

1010
00:39:23,280 --> 00:39:26,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he never really gave me</font></font>

1011
