1012
00:39:27,080 --> 00:39:29,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, a clear answer.</font></font>

1013
00:39:29,000 --> 00:39:31,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We'd just say hello,</font></font>

1014
00:39:31,160 --> 00:39:32,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or something like that.</font></font>

1015
00:39:32,320 --> 00:39:33,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I wondered</font></font>

1016
00:39:33,320 --> 00:39:34,400
