1017
00:39:34,400 --> 00:39:35,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the way he is.</font></font>

1018
00:39:35,400 --> 00:39:36,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He likes to keep things polite.</font></font>

1019
00:39:36,480 --> 00:39:39,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And maybe he thought</font></font>

1020
00:39:39,560 --> 00:39:41,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it wasn't such a big deal.</font></font>

1021
00:39:42,600 --> 00:39:43,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But for me,</font></font>

1022
00:39:43,640 --> 00:39:45,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">without a clear answer,</font></font>

1023
00:39:45,880 --> 00:39:46,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't know.</font></font>

1024
