<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">when I'm around him.</font></font>

1026
00:39:50,120 --> 00:39:51,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Unsure how to face Zheng Shoudong]</font></font>

1027
00:39:51,720 --> 00:39:54,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So I've actually been avoiding him.</font></font>

1028
00:39:54,360 --> 00:39:55,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't really want</font></font>

1029
