1033
00:40:03,360 --> 00:40:04,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

1034
00:40:04,120 --> 00:40:05,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That was your doing too.</font></font>

1035
00:40:05,160 --> 00:40:06,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't know.</font></font>

1036
00:40:06,840 --> 00:40:08,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That was your doing too.</font></font>

1037
00:40:08,000 --> 00:40:08,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I did it again.</font></font>

1038
00:40:08,840 --> 00:40:10,280
