1044
00:40:19,240 --> 00:40:20,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He said to me,</font></font>

1045
00:40:20,880 --> 00:40:22,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">"Let's just</font></font>

1046
00:40:22,400 --> 00:40:26,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">keep getting along as friends,</font></font>

1047
00:40:26,160 --> 00:40:28,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and really enjoy our time on this island."</font></font>

1048
00:40:28,560 --> 00:40:29,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even now, I haven't...</font></font>

1049
00:40:29,600 --> 00:40:30,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't really understand</font></font>

1050
00:40:30,840 --> 00:40:33,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what he meant by that.</font></font>

1051
00:40:33,040 --> 00:40:35,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Quick, help me figure it out.</font></font>

1052
00:40:35,200 --> 00:40:37,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think a woman's intuition</font></font>

1053
00:40:37,040 --> 00:40:38,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">usually isn't wrong.</font></font>

1054
00:40:38,440 --> 00:40:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Taking it all together,</font></font>

1055
00:40:40,680 --> 00:40:43,320
