1059
00:40:49,920 --> 00:40:51,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And he's already dealt with it.</font></font>

1060
00:40:51,480 --> 00:40:52,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He thinks he's dealt with it.</font></font>

1061
00:40:52,920 --> 00:40:53,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

1062
00:40:53,520 --> 00:40:54,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Like, for example,</font></font>

1063
00:40:54,800 --> 00:40:56,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">during the fireworks yesterday,</font></font>

1064
00:40:56,080 --> 00:40:58,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he did some little things without thinking.</font></font>

1065
00:40:58,200 --> 00:40:59,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because the way I see it,</font></font>

1066
00:40:59,560 --> 00:41:01,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">if you don't like me,</font></font>

1067
00:41:01,000 --> 00:41:02,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and you just want to be friends,</font></font>

1068
00:41:02,920 --> 00:41:04,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">don't do anything</font></font>

1069
00:41:04,240 --> 00:41:06,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that could give me the wrong idea.</font></font>

1070
00:41:06,440 --> 00:41:07,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His actions, right?</font></font>

1071
00:41:07,040 --> 00:41:07,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, his actions.</font></font>

1072
00:41:09,160 --> 00:41:11,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll wonder about it,</font></font>

1073
00:41:11,120 --> 00:41:12,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but I won't say anything.</font></font>

1074
00:41:12,000 --> 00:41:14,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The way I see those things he does,</font></font>

1075
