1091
00:41:43,920 --> 00:41:44,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What about you?</font></font>

1092
00:41:45,480 --> 00:41:45,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Me?</font></font>

1093
00:41:46,240 --> 00:41:47,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right now, I don't really</font></font>

1094
00:41:47,560 --> 00:41:50,320
