1095
00:41:50,320 --> 00:41:51,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">To be honest,</font></font>

1096
00:41:51,320 --> 00:41:52,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the reason I'm saying this is...</font></font>

1097
00:41:52,640 --> 00:41:53,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of course I want</font></font>

1098
00:41:53,320 --> 00:41:55,040
