1099
00:41:55,040 --> 00:41:56,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[I'm interested in you too]
I'm interested in you too.</font></font>

1100
00:41:56,720 --> 00:41:57,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's the truth.</font></font>

1101
00:42:01,480 --> 00:42:02,480
