1103
00:42:03,600 --> 00:42:04,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm not joking around.</font></font>

1104
00:42:05,840 --> 00:42:07,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But more than anything,</font></font>

1105
00:42:07,000 --> 00:42:08,480
