1107
00:42:10,080 --> 00:42:11,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I really hope you can</font></font>

1108
00:42:12,040 --> 00:42:15,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">find the person you truly want.</font></font>

1109
00:42:16,080 --> 00:42:16,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So that</font></font>

1110
00:42:18,200 --> 00:42:19,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">every day feels meaningful.</font></font>

1111
00:42:19,800 --> 00:42:23,480
