00:42:29,520 --> 00:42:32,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Resource Supply Room is now open.</font></font>

1115
00:42:32,800 --> 00:42:34,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come to the supply station with me first.</font></font>

1116
00:42:34,280 --> 00:42:35,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's go.</font></font>

1117
00:42:35,200 --> 00:42:35,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's go.</font></font>

1118
00:42:36,960 --> 00:42:39,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've become more like this since I started working.</font></font>

1119
00:42:39,000 --> 00:42:40,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I remember I used to...</font></font>

1120
00:42:40,600 --> 00:42:41,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hi, everyone.</font></font>

1121
00:42:43,240 --> 00:42:43,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hello.</font></font>

1122
00:42:43,840 --> 00:42:44,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hello.</font></font>

1123
00:42:44,840 --> 00:42:45,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was originally</font></font>

1124
00:42:45,960 --> 00:42:47,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">quite similar to Gao.</font></font>

1125
00:42:48,080 --> 00:42:49,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This is honestly hilarious.</font></font>

1126
00:42:54,440 --> 00:42:55,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where did they go?</font></font>

1127
00:43:07,600 --> 00:43:09,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When I went to collect supplies earlier,</font></font>

1128
00:43:09,160 --> 00:43:11,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd actually wanted to go with her,</font></font>

1129
00:43:11,120 --> 00:43:12,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">because we'd won together.</font></font>

1130
00:43:13,360 --> 00:43:15,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[The joy of winning]
I could finally collect some supplies.</font></font>

1131
00:43:15,160 --> 00:43:16,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I even looked toward their room,</font></font>

1132
00:43:16,960 --> 00:43:18,280
