1134
00:43:21,080 --> 00:43:22,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and wondered if I should bring one back for her.</font></font>

1135
00:43:22,640 --> 00:43:23,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">One for Ke'er.</font></font>

1136
00:43:26,800 --> 00:43:29,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then, when I came out</font></font>

1137
00:43:29,360 --> 00:43:30,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">of the supply room, all alone,</font></font>

1138
00:43:32,040 --> 00:43:33,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in the darkness,</font></font>

1139
00:43:33,040 --> 00:43:35,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I ran into them having a great conversation.</font></font>

1140
00:43:37,000 --> 00:43:38,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I quickly said hello,</font></font>

1141
00:43:38,240 --> 00:43:40,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then hurried away.</font></font>

1142
00:43:40,480 --> 00:43:41,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I felt like such a clown.</font></font>

1143
00:43:45,000 --> 00:43:45,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm done.</font></font>

1144
00:43:47,600 --> 00:43:49,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm finished, bro.</font></font>

1145
00:43:49,040 --> 00:43:49,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This is really over.</font></font>

1146
00:43:49,760 --> 00:43:51,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I saw it then.</font></font>

1147
00:43:51,360 --> 00:43:52,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've seen them together twice now.</font></font>

1148
00:43:54,120 --> 00:43:55,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[It's good she's meeting other people]
It's good she's meeting other people.</font></font>

1149
00:43:56,760 --> 00:43:57,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Saying that</font></font>

1150
00:43:57,480 --> 00:43:58,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Must leave a bitter taste]
must leave a bitter taste in your mouth.</font></font>

1151
00:43:59,120 --> 00:44:00,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Good thing I'm eating this.</font></font>

