00:44:01,320 --> 00:44:02,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[At least this is sweet]
At least this is a little sweet.</font></font>

1153
00:44:04,600 --> 00:44:05,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But the tears you shed</font></font>

1154
00:44:05,600 --> 00:44:06,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Your tears must taste more bitter]
probably taste even more bitter.</font></font>

1155
00:44:11,040 --> 00:44:12,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Feng swooped in while I wasn't looking.</font></font>

1156
00:44:12,360 --> 00:44:14,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Someone stole his thunder]</font></font>

1157
00:44:14,720 --> 00:44:16,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All those coffees paid off after all.</font></font>

1158
00:44:20,240 --> 00:44:21,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Maybe they're just chatting]
But maybe they're just chatting?</font></font>

1159
00:44:22,320 --> 00:44:22,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's okay, though.</font></font>

1160
00:44:22,920 --> 00:44:24,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[It's good they're getting acquainted]
I think it's good she gets to know him.</font></font>

1161
00:44:26,240 --> 00:44:27,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It was my issue in the first place.</font></font>

1162
00:44:29,160 --> 00:44:31,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[It was my issue]
I was the one who thought we didn't fit.</font></font>

1163
00:44:31,200 --> 00:44:32,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[I was the one who thought we didn't fit]</font></font>

1164
00:44:32,800 --> 00:44:35,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Then let them get to know each other]
Then let them get to know each other.</font></font>

1165
00:44:38,400 --> 00:44:39,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">At the beginning,</font></font>

1166
00:44:39,880 --> 00:44:41,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you never talked, did you?</font></font>

1167
00:44:41,760 --> 00:44:42,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And if you don't talk,</font></font>

1168
00:44:42,760 --> 00:44:44,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">nobody's really going to notice you.</font></font>

1169
00:44:44,920 --> 00:44:47,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I first really noticed you</font></font>

1170
00:44:47,720 --> 00:44:50,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">because of your love triangle, you know?</font></font>

1171
00:44:50,280 --> 00:44:51,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">With who? Gao?</font></font>

1172
00:44:51,600 --> 00:44:52,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

1173
00:44:52,440 --> 00:44:53,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wouldn't call it a love triangle.</font></font>

1174
00:44:53,480 --> 00:44:55,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's no love yet. Nothing's started.</font></font>

1175
00:44:55,480 --> 00:44:56,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But after that, you and Annie</font></font>

1176
00:44:56,520 --> 00:44:57,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">didn't keep talking.</font></font>

1177
00:44:58,600 --> 00:45:00,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You became this mysterious,</font></font>

1178
00:45:00,840 --> 00:45:02,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">elusive figure again,</font></font>

1179
00:45:02,040 --> 00:45:03,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">who only appears here and in the kitchen,</font></font>

1180
00:45:03,360 --> 00:45:05,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">at regular intervals.</font></font>

1181
00:45:05,320 --> 00:45:06,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A non-player character.</font></font>

1182
00:45:06,000 --> 00:45:07,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, a non-player character.</font></font>

1183
00:45:10,640 --> 00:45:11,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But if you don't talk,</font></font>

1184
00:45:11,560 --> 00:45:13,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">how will anyone notice you?</font></font>

1185
00:45:13,520 --> 00:45:15,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you communicating through brain waves?</font></font>

1186
00:45:16,280 --> 00:45:16,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Not really.</font></font>

1187
00:45:16,760 --> 00:45:18,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">At the time, how do I put it?</font></font>

1188
00:45:18,560 --> 00:45:20,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your mind wasn't really here yet.</font></font>

1189
00:45:20,640 --> 00:45:22,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, I wanted to get to know Shihan then.</font></font>

1190
00:45:22,680 --> 00:45:24,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But later, I didn't really try.</font></font>

1191
00:45:24,960 --> 00:45:26,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was happy just making coffee.</font></font>

1192
00:45:26,360 --> 00:45:27,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">At the time, you...</font></font>

1193
00:45:27,640 --> 00:45:29,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You were still with Dong, right?</font></font>

1194
00:45:29,000 --> 00:45:30,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So I was even less likely to approach you.</font></font>

1195
00:45:33,560 --> 00:45:35,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm so tired of competing every day.</font></font>

1196
00:45:35,920 --> 00:45:38,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, don't worry about how to face him.</font></font>

1197
00:45:38,600 --> 00:45:39,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If, because of this,</font></font>

1198
00:45:39,400 --> 00:45:41,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he doesn't come to talk to us,</font></font>

1199
00:45:41,680 --> 00:45:42,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then there's even less to worry about.</font></font>

1200
00:45:43,160 --> 00:45:44,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The answer's clear.</font></font>

1201
00:45:44,360 --> 00:45:45,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And if he does,</font></font>

1202
00:45:45,560 --> 00:45:47,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">any outcome is fine.</font></font>

1203
00:45:52,000 --> 00:45:54,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How do I put it?</font></font>

1204
00:45:54,920 --> 00:45:56,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's just that</font></font>

1205
00:45:56,600 --> 00:45:57,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Dong and I</font></font>

1206
00:45:57,680 --> 00:45:59,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">have been partners from the start.</font></font>

1207
00:45:59,360 --> 00:46:02,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Maybe I just wanted to stay in my comfort zone.</font></font>

1208
00:46:02,000 --> 00:46:03,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I really like staying in my comfort zone.</font></font>

1209
00:46:03,520 --> 00:46:05,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't want to step out of it</font></font>

1210
00:46:05,560 --> 00:46:07,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to try something else.</font></font>

1211
00:46:07,040 --> 00:46:07,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">After spending all that time</font></font>

1212
00:46:07,760 --> 00:46:08,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">with Dong, I realized</font></font>

1213
00:46:08,640 --> 00:46:10,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">everyone else was starting to explore other connections.</font></font>

1214
00:46:10,840 --> 00:46:13,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then I realized, well, Dong</font></font>

1215
00:46:13,360 --> 00:46:14,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is a really nice person too.</font></font>

1216
00:46:16,120 --> 00:46:17,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Apart from Dong,</font></font>

1217
00:46:17,000 --> 00:46:18,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you haven't talked like this</font></font>

1218
00:46:18,560 --> 00:46:20,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">with any other guy, the way you have with me?</font></font>

1219
00:46:21,120 --> 00:46:21,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Not a single one.</font></font>

1220
00:46:23,440 --> 00:46:24,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, if I want to get to know one person,</font></font>

1221
00:46:24,880 --> 00:46:25,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I focus on that one person.</font></font>

1222
00:46:27,680 --> 00:46:28,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then it's quite a coincidence,</font></font>

1223
00:46:28,920 --> 00:46:29,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">because apart from you,</font></font>

1224
00:46:29,960 --> 00:46:31,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I haven't talked like this with anyone either.</font></font>

1225
00:46:34,760 --> 00:46:36,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We can look forward</font></font>

1226
00:46:36,240 --> 00:46:37,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to seeing Dong's reaction.</font></font>

1227
00:46:38,840 --> 00:46:39,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Now you're looking forward to it.</font></font>

1228
00:46:48,560 --> 00:46:50,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I admit, when I saw Ke'er</font></font>

1229
00:46:50,600 --> 00:46:52,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">getting to know another guy,</font></font>

1230
00:46:52,280 --> 00:46:54,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was 100% jealous.</font></font>

1231
00:46:54,440 --> 00:46:56,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I think</font></font>

1232
00:46:56,880 --> 00:46:58,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it's a good thing too.</font></font>

1233
00:46:59,000 --> 00:47:00,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think everyone,</font></font>

1234
00:47:00,160 --> 00:47:01,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">all of us here,</font></font>

1235
00:47:02,400 --> 00:47:04,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">has the right to get to know other people.</font></font>

1236
00:47:04,320 --> 00:47:08,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think it's a good way forward too.</font></font>

1237
00:47:08,320 --> 00:47:10,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The next day, maybe tomorrow,</font></font>

1238
00:47:10,240 --> 00:47:11,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">when I see her again,</font></font>

1239
00:47:11,080 --> 00:47:13,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and say hello or something,</font></font>

1240
00:47:13,040 --> 00:47:14,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I won't feel so much pressure.</font></font>

1241
00:47:28,680 --> 00:47:29,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I still want more.</font></font>

1242
00:47:29,760 --> 00:47:31,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think we're pretty in sync.</font></font>

1243
00:47:31,880 --> 00:47:32,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of course.</font></font>

1244
00:47:32,360 --> 00:47:33,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shall we try a new game?</font></font>

1245
00:47:33,680 --> 00:47:34,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay, how does it work?</font></font>

1246
00:47:34,800 --> 00:47:35,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wait for me.</font></font>

1247
00:47:35,720 --> 00:47:36,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

1248
00:47:39,600 --> 00:47:40,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have you seen that</font></font>

1249
00:47:40,720 --> 00:47:41,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">viral heart-gesture challenge online?</font></font>

1250
00:47:41,920 --> 00:47:43,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shall we give it a try?</font></font>

1251
00:47:43,040 --> 00:47:45,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Challenge accepted]
Okay, I'll turn on the cover preview.</font></font>

1252
00:47:47,400 --> 00:47:48,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Look over here.</font></font>

1253
00:47:48,800 --> 00:47:50,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Every shot's a keeper.</font></font>

1254
00:47:50,000 --> 00:47:50,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So beautiful.</font></font>

1255
00:47:50,680 --> 00:47:52,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Three, two, one. Make a heart!</font></font>

1256
00:47:52,840 --> 00:47:54,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Perfectly in sync]</font></font>

1257
00:47:54,680 --> 00:47:56,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Bet we can't do it again.</font></font>

1258
00:47:56,520 --> 00:47:57,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Three, two, one. Make a heart!</font></font>

1259
00:47:59,520 --> 00:48:00,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So cool.</font></font>

1260
00:48:01,040 --> 00:48:02,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why do you love showing off so much?</font></font>

1261
00:48:02,480 --> 00:48:04,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Three, two, one. Make a heart!</font></font>

1262
00:48:06,800 --> 00:48:07,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're doing that on purpose.</font></font>

1263
00:48:07,240 --> 00:48:07,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Amazing.</font></font>

1264
00:48:10,120 --> 00:48:12,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Here, have a piece of cold popcorn chicken.</font></font>

1265
00:48:12,440 --> 00:48:13,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No more for me.</font></font>

1266
00:48:13,120 --> 00:48:13,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You have to.</font></font>

1267
00:48:13,880 --> 00:48:14,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Not even one bite?</font></font>

1268
00:48:14,640 --> 00:48:15,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll put it in your mouth.</font></font>

1269
00:48:16,560 --> 00:48:17,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Minus one point.</font></font>

1270
00:48:18,280 --> 00:48:19,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Feed me one of these, okay?</font></font>

1271
00:48:19,520 --> 00:48:20,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Here.</font></font>

1272
00:48:24,000 --> 00:48:25,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's a bit tricky.</font></font>

1273
00:48:26,040 --> 00:48:27,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then have a tomato.</font></font>

1274
00:48:40,280 --> 00:48:41,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Such a strong smell of popcorn chicken.</font></font>

1275
00:48:46,800 --> 00:48:47,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's go.</font></font>

1276
00:48:47,520 --> 00:48:49,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When do I get to see the eighty-point version of you?</font></font>

1277
00:48:49,440 --> 00:48:50,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The dark side.</font></font>

1278
00:48:51,240 --> 00:48:52,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">"Dark side" is a bit much.</font></font>

1279
00:48:52,680 --> 00:48:55,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's the eighty-point version of you like, then?</font></font>

1280
00:48:55,040 --> 00:48:55,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Maybe you'll get a chance tomorrow.</font></font>

1281
00:48:55,960 --> 00:48:56,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Not right now.</font></font>

1282
00:48:56,880 --> 00:48:57,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why?</font></font>

1283
00:48:57,400 --> 00:48:58,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's no chance right now.</font></font>

1284
00:48:58,240 --> 00:48:59,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have you lost that many points?</font></font>

1285
00:48:59,440 --> 00:48:59,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

1286
00:48:59,800 --> 00:49:01,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You have to tell me what cost me points.</font></font>

1287
00:49:01,840 --> 00:49:02,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[A tap]
What cost me points?</font></font>

1288
00:49:03,720 --> 00:49:04,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Take a guess.</font></font>

1289
00:49:04,560 --> 00:49:06,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't just touch girls' hands whenever you feel like it,</font></font>

1290
00:49:06,120 --> 00:49:06,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">okay?</font></font>

1291
00:49:09,200 --> 00:49:10,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you do this with everyone else too?</font></font>

1292
00:49:10,960 --> 00:49:12,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's a bit unfair of you to say,</font></font>

1293
00:49:12,240 --> 00:49:13,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Honestly,</font></font>

1294
00:49:13,560 --> 00:49:15,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're the same with everyone.</font></font>

1295
00:49:15,280 --> 00:49:17,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Whose hand do you think I've touched?</font></font>

1296
00:49:17,400 --> 00:49:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've touched loads of people's hands.</font></font>

1297
00:49:18,520 --> 00:49:18,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">For example?</font></font>

1298
00:49:18,760 --> 00:49:19,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Zhang Yi's.</font></font>

1299
00:49:20,640 --> 00:49:22,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We were playing a game.</font></font>

1300
00:49:23,040 --> 00:49:24,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So what if it was a game?</font></font>

1301
00:49:24,200 --> 00:49:25,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't touch anyone during a game?</font></font>

1302
00:49:25,120 --> 00:49:25,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

1303
00:49:26,920 --> 00:49:28,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You were hugging someone in the photo shoot too.</font></font>

1304
00:49:29,160 --> 00:49:30,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who did I hug?</font></font>

1305
00:49:30,080 --> 00:49:30,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who did you hug?</font></font>

1306
00:49:30,720 --> 00:49:31,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who did I hug?</font></font>

1307
00:49:31,480 --> 00:49:32,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You hugged your little...</font></font>

1308
00:49:32,800 --> 00:49:33,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You hugged my good friend.</font></font>

1309
00:49:37,240 --> 00:49:38,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I saw it perfectly clearly.</font></font>

1310
00:49:39,440 --> 00:49:40,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was at the drinks counter.</font></font>

1311
00:49:40,440 --> 00:49:42,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Zhang Yi and I had front-row seats to the drama.</font></font>

1312
00:49:42,920 --> 00:49:43,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Really?</font></font>

1313
00:49:43,320 --> 00:49:45,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did you enjoy the show?</font></font>

1314
00:49:45,040 --> 00:49:45,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Very much.</font></font>

1315
00:49:46,160 --> 00:49:48,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We ate that whole plate of watermelon.</font></font>

1316
00:49:48,000 --> 00:49:48,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There were only two pieces left.</font></font>

1317
00:49:53,240 --> 00:49:54,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's make some noodles.</font></font>

1318
00:49:54,600 --> 00:49:55,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

1319
00:49:55,800 --> 00:49:57,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to go off the island.</font></font>

1320
00:49:57,640 --> 00:49:59,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then why didn't you choose me?</font></font>

1321
00:49:59,520 --> 00:50:00,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When didn't I choose you?</font></font>

1322
00:50:00,600 --> 00:50:01,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right, that cost you points too.</font></font>

1323
00:50:01,920 --> 00:50:03,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Now I remember.</font></font>

1324
00:50:03,120 --> 00:50:04,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why didn't you</font></font>

1325
00:50:04,320 --> 00:50:06,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">say my name with more certainty?</font></font>

1326
00:50:06,600 --> 00:50:08,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What? When?</font></font>

1327
00:50:08,040 --> 00:50:09,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When we talked about hiking.</font></font>

1328
00:50:10,640 --> 00:50:11,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do I have to go hiking with you,</font></font>

1329
00:50:11,880 --> 00:50:12,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yang.</font></font>

1330
00:50:12,200 --> 00:50:13,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You don't even like hiking.</font></font>

1331
00:50:13,080 --> 00:50:14,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why would I go hiking with you?</font></font>

1332
00:50:17,560 --> 00:50:19,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How do you know I don't like hiking?</font></font>

1333
00:50:19,360 --> 00:50:20,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You really like hiking?</font></font>

1334
00:50:20,360 --> 00:50:21,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why don't I believe you?</font></font>

1335
00:50:21,120 --> 00:50:22,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes, I love hiking.</font></font>

1336
00:50:22,160 --> 00:50:22,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Seriously?</font></font>

1337
00:50:23,560 --> 00:50:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I go hiking every week.</font></font>

1338
00:50:25,240 --> 00:50:26,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When I introduced myself,</font></font>

1339
00:50:26,560 --> 00:50:27,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">didn't I say</font></font>

1340
00:50:27,360 --> 00:50:28,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I like anything</font></font>

1341
00:50:28,760 --> 00:50:30,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and everything to do with sports?</font></font>

1342
00:50:33,640 --> 00:50:33,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yang.</font></font>

1343
00:50:33,880 --> 00:50:34,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Could you bring it over for me?</font></font>

1344
00:50:40,400 --> 00:50:41,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You can sit beside me.</font></font>

1345
00:50:41,480 --> 00:50:42,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[An invitation]</font></font>

1346
00:50:43,600 --> 00:50:45,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm scared to sit too close to girls now.</font></font>

1347
00:50:45,040 --> 00:50:45,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm shy.</font></font>

1348
00:50:46,600 --> 00:50:48,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then sit by the door and eat.</font></font>

1349
00:50:51,800 --> 00:50:52,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Delicious.</font></font>

1350
00:50:52,600 --> 00:50:53,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Seriously?</font></font>

1351
00:50:53,280 --> 00:50:54,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Really.</font></font>

1352
00:50:54,120 --> 00:50:57,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Obediently taking a seat]</font></font>

1353
00:50:58,160 --> 00:50:59,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I really want to know what they're doing off the island.</font></font>

1354
00:51:01,680 --> 00:51:02,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll get my phone in a bit</font></font>

1355
00:51:02,440 --> 00:51:03,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and call Gao.</font></font>

1356
00:51:03,840 --> 00:51:04,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I think Annie</font></font>

1357
00:51:04,640 --> 00:51:06,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">seems a little down today.</font></font>

1358
00:51:06,600 --> 00:51:07,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Down?</font></font>

1359
00:51:07,680 --> 00:51:08,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Really?</font></font>

1360
00:51:08,360 --> 00:51:08,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A little.</font></font>

1361
00:51:11,680 --> 00:51:12,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did you want to...</font></font>

1362
00:51:12,920 --> 00:51:14,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did you want to win?</font></font>

1363
00:51:15,480 --> 00:51:16,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to win. I really do.</font></font>

1364
00:51:16,640 --> 00:51:18,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to go off the island.</font></font>

1365
00:51:18,360 --> 00:51:19,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who would you invite?</font></font>

1366
00:51:19,880 --> 00:51:20,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who?</font></font>

1367
00:51:21,280 --> 00:51:21,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What?</font></font>

1368
00:51:21,680 --> 00:51:22,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You wouldn't invite someone else, would you?</font></font>

1369
00:51:23,720 --> 00:51:24,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who?</font></font>

1370
00:51:24,440 --> 00:51:25,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I mean you...</font></font>

1371
00:51:26,360 --> 00:51:27,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who do you want me to invite?</font></font>

1372
00:51:28,560 --> 00:51:29,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of course I want you to invite me.</font></font>

1373
00:51:29,880 --> 00:51:31,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[I want you to invite me]</font></font>

1374
00:51:33,280 --> 00:51:34,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you choose someone else,</font></font>

1375
00:51:34,120 --> 00:51:35,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it'll be a three-person date.</font></font>

1376
00:51:35,640 --> 00:51:36,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wouldn't that be fun?</font></font>

1377
00:51:36,520 --> 00:51:37,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We can all go hiking.</font></font>

1378
00:51:37,000 --> 00:51:38,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Aren't you used to that already?</font></font>

1379
00:51:41,840 --> 00:51:43,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[More vinegar, please]
These noodles aren't sour enough.</font></font>

1380
00:51:44,680 --> 00:51:45,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have you heard the theorem</font></font>

1381
00:51:45,720 --> 00:51:47,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that a triangle is a stable structure?</font></font>

1382
00:51:47,800 --> 00:51:49,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Stop saying these ridiculous things,</font></font>

1383
00:51:49,720 --> 00:51:50,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Honestly,</font></font>

1384
00:51:58,000 --> 00:51:59,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm talking about geometry.</font></font>

1385
00:51:59,160 --> 00:51:59,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What are you talking about?</font></font>

1386
00:52:01,320 --> 00:52:02,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm speechless, professor.</font></font>

1387
00:52:02,120 --> 00:52:02,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Speechless.</font></font>

1388
00:52:08,240 --> 00:52:09,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's my score now?</font></font>

1389
00:52:11,080 --> 00:52:13,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to see the eighty-point version of you.</font></font>

1390
00:52:15,120 --> 00:52:15,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Haven't you noticed</font></font>

1391
00:52:15,960 --> 00:52:17,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've started changing?</font></font>

1392
00:52:18,520 --> 00:52:19,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Changing into what?</font></font>

1393
00:52:21,760 --> 00:52:22,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You'll see, little by little.</font></font>

1394
00:52:28,040 --> 00:52:30,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Was choosing Zhang Yi part of that change too?</font></font>

1395
00:52:34,120 --> 00:52:35,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[This afternoon: Romance Training]
I'll choose.</font></font>

1396
00:52:35,600 --> 00:52:36,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Choosing Zhang Yi as his teammate]
Zhang Yi.</font></font>

1397
00:52:37,520 --> 00:52:38,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come on.</font></font>

1398
00:52:41,280 --> 00:52:42,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm choosing Wang Tianqing next time too,</font></font>

1399
00:52:42,400 --> 00:52:42,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">just so you know.</font></font>

1400
00:52:42,880 --> 00:52:44,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because you chose Zhang Yi today,</font></font>

1401
00:52:44,680 --> 00:52:46,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm choosing Wang Tianqing next time.</font></font>

1402
00:52:47,400 --> 00:52:50,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is that really a conclusion you can draw?</font></font>

1403
00:52:50,920 --> 00:52:52,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then why did you choose Zhang Yi?</font></font>

1404
00:52:54,160 --> 00:52:55,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I chose Zhang Yi because</font></font>

1405
00:52:56,560 --> 00:52:58,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't want her to feel awkward.</font></font>

1406
00:52:58,520 --> 00:53:00,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't want to make it awkward for Wang Tianqing.</font></font>

1407
00:53:02,640 --> 00:53:04,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's fine. He's having a good time.</font></font>

1408
00:53:04,440 --> 00:53:05,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He was so happy yesterday.</font></font>

1409
00:53:13,520 --> 00:53:14,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wanted to tease you</font></font>

1410
00:53:14,360 --> 00:53:16,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and see if you'd get jealous, okay?</font></font>

1411
00:53:18,520 --> 00:53:19,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was jealous.</font></font>

1412
00:53:20,240 --> 00:53:21,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Jealous?</font></font>

1413
00:53:21,040 --> 00:53:21,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

1414
00:53:21,600 --> 00:53:22,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I thought you chose Zhang Yi</font></font>

1415
00:53:22,520 --> 00:53:24,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">because you didn't want her to feel awkward.</font></font>

1416
00:53:24,000 --> 00:53:26,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I could understand that.</font></font>

1417
00:53:26,160 --> 00:53:27,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But if you really did it</font></font>

1418
00:53:27,560 --> 00:53:29,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">just to make me jealous,</font></font>

1419
00:53:30,400 --> 00:53:31,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then let's give each other the silent treatment.</font></font>

1420
00:53:32,200 --> 00:53:33,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I really didn't want her to feel awkward.</font></font>

1421
00:53:33,600 --> 00:53:35,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because Zhang Yi doesn't</font></font>

1422
00:53:35,640 --> 00:53:37,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">have anyone she's interested in.</font></font>

1423
00:53:37,080 --> 00:53:38,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think she's finding this island</font></font>

1424
00:53:38,840 --> 00:53:39,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a bit boring.</font></font>

1425
00:53:39,680 --> 00:53:41,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So sometimes I really</font></font>

1426
00:53:42,520 --> 00:53:44,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">feel for her.</font></font>

1427
00:53:44,120 --> 00:53:47,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What about your other female friends?</font></font>

1428
00:53:47,160 --> 00:53:48,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Will you always put their feelings first,</font></font>

1429
00:53:49,480 --> 00:53:50,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">even if it makes me feel</font></font>

1430
00:53:51,320 --> 00:53:53,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a little uncomfortable?</font></font>

1431
00:53:53,280 --> 00:53:54,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, I wouldn't.</font></font>

1432
00:53:54,720 --> 00:53:56,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We need to communicate properly.</font></font>

1433
00:53:56,560 --> 00:53:58,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But you weren't going to talk to me about it today</font></font>

1434
00:53:58,640 --> 00:53:59,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">until I brought it up.</font></font>

1435
00:54:03,680 --> 00:54:04,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because I knew</font></font>

1436
00:54:04,720 --> 00:54:07,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it was only a small issue.</font></font>

1437
00:54:07,400 --> 00:54:08,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It would've been over quickly.</font></font>

1438
00:54:12,920 --> 00:54:13,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's walk and talk.</font></font>

1439
00:54:13,960 --> 00:54:14,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's go.</font></font>

1440
00:54:15,480 --> 00:54:18,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm worried that this enthusiasm of yours</font></font>

1441
00:54:18,280 --> 00:54:20,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is just a passing impulse.</font></font>

1442
00:54:20,360 --> 00:54:21,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You get swept up in the moment,</font></font>

1443
00:54:21,320 --> 00:54:23,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then it quickly fades,</font></font>

1444
00:54:23,200 --> 00:54:24,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and disappears just as fast.</font></font>

1445
00:54:26,160 --> 00:54:27,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm scared it'll be like</font></font>

1446
00:54:27,960 --> 00:54:28,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">fireworks,</font></font>

1447
00:54:28,920 --> 00:54:30,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">over in an instant.</font></font>

1448
00:54:31,720 --> 00:54:33,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I feel like with you, I'm already</font></font>

1449
00:54:33,360 --> 00:54:34,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">not being that intense.</font></font>

1450
00:54:34,880 --> 00:54:36,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think it's pretty normal.</font></font>

1451
00:54:36,320 --> 00:54:36,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Really?</font></font>

1452
00:54:36,920 --> 00:54:37,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

1453
00:54:37,840 --> 00:54:39,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Maybe I'm only like this with you.</font></font>

1454
00:54:39,440 --> 00:54:40,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I honestly haven't</font></font>

1455
00:54:40,320 --> 00:54:41,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">noticed myself being that intense.</font></font>

1456
00:54:42,960 --> 00:54:44,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You think you're just...</font></font>

1457
00:54:44,400 --> 00:54:45,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Maybe I just naturally</font></font>

1458
00:54:45,760 --> 00:54:47,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">want to do these things for you.</font></font>

1459
00:54:49,040 --> 00:54:50,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So you mean</font></font>

1460
00:54:50,560 --> 00:54:52,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you're even more intense with other people?</font></font>

1461
00:54:52,240 --> 00:54:53,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't do this for anyone else.</font></font>

1462
00:54:54,480 --> 00:54:56,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">With other people, I wait for them to approach me.</font></font>

1463
00:54:59,560 --> 00:55:00,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's why I think</font></font>

1464
00:55:00,240 --> 00:55:01,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">sometimes I do things naturally,</font></font>

1465
00:55:02,880 --> 00:55:04,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">without even realizing</font></font>

1466
00:55:04,560 --> 00:55:06,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">how intense they seem.</font></font>

1467
00:55:06,520 --> 00:55:08,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I feel like I haven't done much.</font></font>

1468
00:55:08,640 --> 00:55:09,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You have.</font></font>

1469
00:55:09,600 --> 00:55:11,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lots of little thoughtful things.</font></font>

1470
00:55:13,360 --> 00:55:15,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I do it because I like her.</font></font>

1471
00:55:15,680 --> 00:55:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[I do these things because I like her]</font></font>

1472
00:55:18,520 --> 00:55:20,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Doing those things,</font></font>

1473
00:55:20,000 --> 00:55:22,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to stay true to how I feel.</font></font>

1474
00:55:25,760 --> 00:55:27,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's so sincere.</font></font>

1475
00:55:27,720 --> 00:55:29,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't have to test him</font></font>

1476
00:55:29,040 --> 00:55:30,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to know how he feels.</font></font>

1477
00:55:30,600 --> 00:55:34,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let it develop slowly.</font></font>

1478
00:55:34,320 --> 00:55:35,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't want to give him</font></font>

1479
00:55:35,720 --> 00:55:36,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a definite answer too quickly.</font></font>

1480
00:55:36,800 --> 00:55:38,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm scared.</font></font>

1481
00:55:38,080 --> 00:55:39,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm scared his enthusiasm</font></font>

1482
00:55:39,160 --> 00:55:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is just a passing impulse.</font></font>

1483
00:55:40,840 --> 00:55:41,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So I really want to know</font></font>

1484
00:55:41,960 --> 00:55:43,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">how long his feelings will last.</font></font>

1485
00:55:43,760 --> 00:55:45,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Until he gives me</font></font>

1486
00:55:45,120 --> 00:55:46,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a real, lasting sense of security,</font></font>

1487
00:55:46,560 --> 00:55:49,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I won't give him a definite answer.</font></font>

1488
00:55:51,920 --> 00:55:52,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay, go get some rest.</font></font>

1489
00:55:55,480 --> 00:55:56,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Bye.</font></font>

1490
00:55:56,280 --> 00:55:59,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Her feelings and doubts are real. Give her time to say yes.]</font></font>

1491
00:56:05,400 --> 00:56:06,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Want to watch a movie?</font></font>

1492
00:56:08,120 --> 00:56:08,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

1493
00:56:08,840 --> 00:56:09,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Invitation accepted]</font></font>

1494
00:56:09,760 --> 00:56:10,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's find somewhere.</font></font>

1495
00:56:10,920 --> 00:56:11,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's go.</font></font>

1496
00:56:14,880 --> 00:56:16,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This TV is huge.</font></font>

1497
00:56:16,520 --> 00:56:17,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We really have to watch something.</font></font>

1498
00:56:27,800 --> 00:56:29,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Turn it down a little.</font></font>

1499
00:56:29,040 --> 00:56:29,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

1500
00:56:35,280 --> 00:56:36,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is this the first one?</font></font>

1501
00:56:36,400 --> 00:56:37,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The first one.</font></font>

1502
00:56:41,680 --> 00:56:43,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Movies deserve your full attention]</font></font>

1503
00:56:49,480 --> 00:56:51,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Giving the mood some room]</font></font>

1504
00:56:55,120 --> 00:56:56,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[A quick peek]</font></font>

1505
00:57:01,800 --> 00:57:02,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right, I asked you earlier,</font></font>

1506
00:57:02,480 --> 00:57:03,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Not really watching the movie]
but you never answered.</font></font>

1507
00:57:03,480 --> 00:57:04,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just remembered.</font></font>

1508
00:57:05,160 --> 00:57:07,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What can a guy do to make your heart flutter?</font></font>

1509
00:57:10,000 --> 00:57:11,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't think a guy's appeal</font></font>

1510
00:57:11,040 --> 00:57:12,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is about what he does for me.</font></font>

1511
00:57:12,360 --> 00:57:13,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It could just be</font></font>

1512
00:57:13,560 --> 00:57:16,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">him working hard,</font></font>

1513
00:57:16,640 --> 00:57:18,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or concentrating on something of his own.</font></font>

1514
00:57:18,840 --> 00:57:20,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I find that attractive.</font></font>

1515
00:57:22,080 --> 00:57:23,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What kind of appeal makes you want a relationship?</font></font>

1516
00:57:24,840 --> 00:57:26,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What would make you want to date someone?</font></font>

1517
00:57:26,160 --> 00:57:28,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't give me such a formal answer.</font></font>

1518
00:57:28,080 --> 00:57:28,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm not being formal.</font></font>

1519
00:57:28,960 --> 00:57:29,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why do you think...?</font></font>

1520
00:57:29,840 --> 00:57:30,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Moving closer]
I don't think I'm being formal.</font></font>

1521
00:57:30,920 --> 00:57:31,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just think</font></font>

1522
00:57:32,600 --> 00:57:34,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a guy who's focused is the most attractive.</font></font>

1523
00:57:35,960 --> 00:57:38,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm quite different from you.</font></font>

1524
00:57:38,240 --> 00:57:40,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think I've always been quite...</font></font>

1525
00:57:40,280 --> 00:57:41,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Quite specific.</font></font>

1526
00:57:43,960 --> 00:57:45,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Most of the time,</font></font>

1527
00:57:46,120 --> 00:57:47,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to other people, don't I seem</font></font>

1528
00:57:49,800 --> 00:57:50,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">cold,</font></font>

1529
00:57:50,760 --> 00:57:53,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or a little reserved?</font></font>

1530
00:57:55,720 --> 00:57:57,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I don't think that's who I am inside.</font></font>

1531
00:57:59,320 --> 00:58:01,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When someone understands me...</font></font>

1532
00:58:04,560 --> 00:58:05,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then what?</font></font>

1533
00:58:06,280 --> 00:58:09,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So being understood makes your heart flutter?</font></font>

1534
00:58:09,400 --> 00:58:11,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, because very few people think that way.</font></font>

1535
00:58:11,720 --> 00:58:13,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Most people think</font></font>

1536
00:58:14,480 --> 00:58:16,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you're boring,</font></font>

1537
00:58:16,280 --> 00:58:18,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you're so...</font></font>

1538
00:58:19,520 --> 00:58:20,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even though I've heard it a lot,</font></font>

1539
00:58:20,560 --> 00:58:23,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it still hurts.</font></font>

1540
00:58:29,720 --> 00:58:30,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Want some fruit?</font></font>

1541
00:58:31,520 --> 00:58:32,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Bring it over.</font></font>

1542
00:58:35,760 --> 00:58:36,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Moving closer]
Here.</font></font>

1543
00:58:36,680 --> 00:58:38,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have you had moments like that?</font></font>

1544
00:58:38,880 --> 00:58:39,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of feeling understood,</font></font>

1545
00:58:39,920 --> 00:58:41,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or something like that?</font></font>

1546
00:58:41,400 --> 00:58:42,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes.</font></font>

1547
00:58:42,400 --> 00:58:44,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">In my past relationships,</font></font>

1548
00:58:44,080 --> 00:58:45,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it was often because of those things.</font></font>

1549
00:58:45,560 --> 00:58:47,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But it's rare.</font></font>

1550
00:58:47,280 --> 00:58:48,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's why I told you,</font></font>

1551
00:58:49,400 --> 00:58:50,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">back when I was at school,</font></font>

1552
00:58:50,920 --> 00:58:51,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">with girls,</font></font>

1553
00:58:51,920 --> 00:58:53,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">like classmates,</font></font>

1554
00:58:54,040 --> 00:58:55,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we had more chances to spend time together.</font></font>

1555
00:58:55,600 --> 00:58:58,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We saw each other all the time.</font></font>

1556
00:58:59,360 --> 00:59:01,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But after leaving school,</font></font>

1557
00:59:02,480 --> 00:59:03,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">those chances became rare.</font></font>

1558
00:59:08,720 --> 00:59:09,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But as a model,</font></font>

1559
00:59:09,840 --> 00:59:12,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">don't you meet lots of</font></font>

1560
00:59:12,320 --> 00:59:13,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">female partners?</font></font>

1561
00:59:18,680 --> 00:59:19,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I haven't met anyone like that.</font></font>

1562
00:59:19,400 --> 00:59:21,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My partners are all pretty polite.</font></font>

1563
00:59:22,440 --> 00:59:24,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did you think I was a model at first?</font></font>

1564
00:59:25,040 --> 00:59:25,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes.</font></font>

1565
00:59:26,400 --> 00:59:27,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes, from the first glance,</font></font>

1566
00:59:27,600 --> 00:59:28,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that's what I thought.</font></font>

1567
00:59:30,080 --> 00:59:32,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I said my ideal type has a model's face.</font></font>

1568
00:59:32,760 --> 00:59:35,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[You're my ideal type]</font></font>

1569
00:59:37,280 --> 00:59:38,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A werewolf.</font></font>

1570
00:59:38,080 --> 00:59:38,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A vampire.</font></font>

1571
00:59:38,560 --> 00:59:39,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's a vampire too, right?</font></font>

1572
00:59:39,960 --> 00:59:41,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Every time they bite someone,</font></font>

1573
00:59:41,080 --> 00:59:42,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">does that person die?</font></font>

1574
00:59:43,040 --> 00:59:44,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They can...</font></font>

1575
00:59:44,080 --> 00:59:44,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Moving closer]</font></font>

1576
00:59:44,920 --> 00:59:46,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There are...</font></font>

1577
00:59:46,560 --> 00:59:48,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Lying down]
More civilized vampires.</font></font>

1578
00:59:48,320 --> 00:59:49,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They can turn other people</font></font>

1579
00:59:49,320 --> 00:59:50,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">into vampires.</font></font>

1580
00:59:50,120 --> 00:59:52,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If they bite you,</font></font>

1581
00:59:52,000 --> 00:59:52,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">once they've bitten you</font></font>

1582
00:59:52,800 --> 00:59:53,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and tasted your blood,</font></font>

1583
00:59:53,800 --> 00:59:55,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">they'll want to drain you dry.</font></font>

1584
00:59:56,200 --> 00:59:57,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is he one of them?</font></font>

1585
00:59:57,320 --> 00:59:58,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is Robert one of the civilized ones?</font></font>

1586
00:59:58,800 --> 00:59:59,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He is.</font></font>

1587
01:00:03,920 --> 01:00:05,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What was your personality like before?</font></font>

1588
01:00:06,240 --> 01:00:07,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Before university?</font></font>

1589
01:00:08,520 --> 01:00:09,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was pretty difficult.</font></font>

1590
01:00:09,600 --> 01:00:11,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">In my last relationship,</font></font>

1591
01:00:11,400 --> 01:00:12,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">were you different from now?</font></font>

1592
01:00:12,720 --> 01:00:13,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Very different.</font></font>

1593
01:00:14,640 --> 01:00:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What do you mean, difficult?</font></font>

1594
01:00:16,040 --> 01:00:18,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Few people actually call themselves difficult.</font></font>

1595
01:00:20,400 --> 01:00:21,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Very difficult.</font></font>

1596
01:00:23,240 --> 01:00:24,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I got upset really easily,</font></font>

1597
01:00:24,880 --> 01:00:25,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and when I did, I'd give him the silent treatment.</font></font>

1598
01:00:27,880 --> 01:00:28,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wouldn't argue when I was angry.</font></font>

1599
01:00:28,920 --> 01:00:29,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd stop talking.</font></font>

1600
01:00:31,160 --> 01:00:32,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you understand?</font></font>

1601
01:00:34,160 --> 01:00:34,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I understand.</font></font>

1602
01:00:34,840 --> 01:00:35,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I can't relate,</font></font>

1603
01:00:36,280 --> 01:00:38,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">because I'd never do that.</font></font>

1604
01:00:38,120 --> 01:00:38,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I understand,</font></font>

1605
01:00:38,960 --> 01:00:40,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">because I get what you're saying.</font></font>

1606
01:00:42,800 --> 01:00:43,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's okay.</font></font>

1607
01:00:43,960 --> 01:00:44,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As long as you've changed.</font></font>

1608
01:00:45,400 --> 01:00:46,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Otherwise, it'd be a bit...</font></font>

1609
01:00:47,880 --> 01:00:50,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A bit tiring, right?</font></font>

1610
01:00:50,400 --> 01:00:51,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You'd wear the other person out a little.</font></font>

1611
01:00:51,560 --> 01:00:52,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

1612
01:00:55,360 --> 01:00:56,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So at the start of our relationship,</font></font>

1613
01:00:56,360 --> 01:00:57,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he was very patient with me.</font></font>

1614
01:00:57,760 --> 01:00:59,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So your ex</font></font>

1615
01:00:59,240 --> 01:01:00,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">saw you through a lot of different phases.</font></font>

1616
01:01:00,800 --> 01:01:01,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A lot of phases.</font></font>

1617
01:01:05,120 --> 01:01:06,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then why did you break up in the end,</font></font>

1618
01:01:06,640 --> 01:01:07,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">if he was such a good guy?</font></font>

1619
01:01:09,640 --> 01:01:11,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He had his faults too.</font></font>

1620
01:01:11,400 --> 01:01:13,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I don't want to talk about those.</font></font>

1621
01:01:13,760 --> 01:01:15,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We didn't break up</font></font>

1622
01:01:15,080 --> 01:01:17,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">because of some fundamental betrayal.</font></font>

1623
01:01:17,120 --> 01:01:18,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It was really just that</font></font>

1624
01:01:18,160 --> 01:01:20,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">our priorities and lives</font></font>

1625
01:01:20,960 --> 01:01:22,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and goals had become different.</font></font>

1626
01:01:22,480 --> 01:01:23,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You were the one who ended it, right?</font></font>

1627
01:01:25,080 --> 01:01:26,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">In the end, it felt like</font></font>

1628
01:01:26,200 --> 01:01:27,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">being in that relationship</font></font>

1629
01:01:27,160 --> 01:01:28,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">wasn't really necessary anymore.</font></font>

1630
01:01:28,720 --> 01:01:29,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can you fall in love at first sight?</font></font>

1631
01:01:30,760 --> 01:01:31,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

1632
01:01:32,840 --> 01:01:34,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">At first sight, I might feel</font></font>

1633
01:01:34,320 --> 01:01:36,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd like to get to know someone.</font></font>

1634
01:01:36,080 --> 01:01:37,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

1635
01:01:37,120 --> 01:01:39,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But "love" feels too strong a word.</font></font>

1636
01:01:39,200 --> 01:01:40,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've never experienced that either.</font></font>

1637
01:01:46,360 --> 01:01:47,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Want some?</font></font>

1638
01:02:05,640 --> 01:02:07,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What about you and your ex?</font></font>

1639
01:02:08,400 --> 01:02:09,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you really want to talk about this, or...?</font></font>

1640
